NOTE ON CHARACTERS: this MIT license covers the game code, the mocap trick
animations (assets/anims), the skateboard model, and the trick pipeline
(pipeline/). It does NOT cover assets/creator-min — the rider characters,
outfits, hair, basemeshes and the embedded creator SDK. Those were made with
and are licensed by creategamecharacters.ai (use in free games is permitted
under the platform's license; see
https://creategamecharacters.com/agent/integration/licensing.md).
They are included here so the published game is playable as-is.
